Description: grommunio Archive: email archiving solution (based on Piler)
 grommunio Archive is an open source email archiving system based on Piler
 (mailpiler.org). Mail is copied to it by the MTA over SMTP, stored
 compressed and deduplicated, and indexed for full text search with Sphinx.
 .
 Features include archiving and retention rules, legal hold, deduplication,
 digital fingerprinting and verification, tagging, viewing, exporting and
 restoring messages, bulk import/export, audit logs and IMAP import (Google
 Apps, Office 365 and others). The web interface is written in PHP.
 .
 Run grommunio-archive-setup after the installation to create the database,
 the configuration and the search index and to enable the services.
